(c3) Li(ehh)be(hi)rá(i)sti(i) nos,(i) *() Dó(i)mi(i)ne,(i) ex(i) af(i)fli(i)gén(j)ti(hi)bus(i) nos:(hiHG.) (:)
et(fi) é(i)os(i) qui(i) nos(i) o(i)dé(i)runt,(iji/ghg) con(fe)fu(ghg)dí(fgF'E)sti.(e.) (::)
<sp>V/</sp>. In(ehh) Dé(hi)o(i) lau(i)dá(i)bi(i)mur(ij) tó(ji)ta(hi) dí(ij/ki)e,(i.) (:)
et(fi) nó(i)mi(i)ni(i) tú(ih/ij)o(i) con(i)fi(i)té(i)bi(i)mur(iji/ghg) in(fe) saé(ghg)cu(fgF'E)la.(e.) (::)
